      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Cloud%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1995, the Veteran’s Memorial Library relocated to a former SunTrust bank on 13th Street and Indiana Avenue.",
